REST-API JSON

1) GET /users -----> display all the user(for browser : responce in html(ssr)) -------------------------------------------------(DONE)
2) GET /api/users -----> Display all the user (for api (application and mobile) : responce in json(csr) )-----------------------(DONE)

3) GET /api/users/1  -----> display the user with the id 1 (json)(CSR)----------------------------------------------------------(DONE)
4) GET /users/2  -----> diaply the user with the is 2 (HTML)(SSR)---------------------------------------------------------------(DONE)

    use Dynamic path parameter
    e.g. GET /api/user/:id --------> here id is a variable | DYNAMIC 
4) POST /api/users -----> add new user.
5) PATCH /api/users/1  --------->   UPDATE the user with id 1
6) DELETE /api/users/1  -------->  DELETE the user with id 1






